la><invention-title load-source="docdb" status="new" lang="EN">BROADCASTING SYSTEM</invention-title><invention-title load-source="docdb" status="new" lang="FR">SYSTEME DE RADIODIFFUSION</invention-title><citations><patent-citations><patcit ucid="EP-0831606-A2" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>EP</country><doc-number>0831606</doc-number><kind>A2</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A"  name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-10276145-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>10276145</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A" name="SEA"  created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-11136649-A"  status="new"><document-id status="new"  format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>11136649</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="X" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-8084126-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>8084126</doc-number> <kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="X" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations> <non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1104128A1</text> <sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources> </nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC IND CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SONODA YASUYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMAMURO KEISEI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC INDUSTRIAL CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SONODA, YASUYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMAMURO, KEISEI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SONODA YASUYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMAMURO KEISEI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SONODA, YASUYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMAMURO, KEISEI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A digital broadcasting transmitter (31) transmits a program to digital broadcasting receivers (41) and in case of emergency transmits emergency information. In a digital broadcasting system (51), an event message is also transmitted when emergency information is transmitted. The event message includes a message ID composed of numerals and characters and an output content being the content of the emergency information. Each of the digital broadcasting receivers (41) having received the event message determines the output form on the basis of the message ID. The output form defines the rule according to which the output content is displayed on a display (417). The output content is displayed on a display (417) in the determined output form.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un émetteur (31) de radiodiffusion numérique qui émet un programme pour des récepteurs (41) de radiodiffusion numérique, et en cas d'urgence, émet une information d'urgence. Dans un système (51) de radiodiffusion numérique, un message d'événement est également émit lorsque l'information d'urgence est émise. Le message d'événement contient un code d'identification de message composé de numéros et de caractères et un contenu de sortie représentant le contenu de l'information d'urgence. Chacun des récepteurs (41) de radiodiffusion numérique ayant reçu le message d'événement détermine la forme de sortie sur la base du code d'identification de message. La forme de sortie définit la règle selon laquelle le contenu de sortie est affiché sur un affichage (417). Le contenu de sortie est affiché sur un affichage (417) sous la forme de sortie déterminée.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>